    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Security and Compliance Officer at our company's, I can confirm that our company's holds ISO 27001 certification since 2023, which covers the scope of development, delivery, and operations. our company's also have ISO 27701 certification, which is an extension for privacy information management." ;
