        ex:hasText "Given our company's legal standing, procurement experience across EU jurisdictions, IP model, insurance, standard contractual clauses, and AI regulatory posture (GDPR, EU AI Act) as of 2024, what are the potential legal risks and liabilities associated with this project, and how can our company's mitigate the potential legal risks and liabilities associated with this project?" ;
