    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's context, I have identified several key aspects that relate to The client demands for strict compliance with GDPR, medical confidentiality, and other regulatory constraints.  our company's, is a Société par actions simplifiée (SAS) registered in France, which indicates our company's are subject to French law and EU regulations, including GDPR. our company's have experience with public procurement, including framework agreements and standard public clauses like CCAG-TIC, which suggests familiarity with contractual requirements in EU." ;
