        ex:hasText "In terms of data protection, our client retains full ownership of our client documents and data produced. our have a reversibility plan in place for the return and deletion of client data at the end of contracts, which aligns with GDPR principles on data minimization and the right to erasure. our maintain professional liability insurance of €10 million per claim and general civil liability cover, which provides some protection against potential damages or losses." ;
