    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate potential legal risks and liabilities: 1. **Ensure GDPR Compliance**: Strict adherence to GDPR principles, especially since health data is considered special category data under Art. 9. 2. **Maintain Medical Confidentiality**: Implement robust measures to protect sensitive patient information in line with medical confidentiality obligations. 3. **Contractual Protections**: Incorporate standard contractual clauses that address data protection and liability in case of breaches or non-compliance. 4. **Insurance Coverage**: Rely on our professional liability insurance to cover potential damages, ensuring our have adequate financial protection. 5. **Compliance Monitoring**: Continuously monitor regulatory obligations through our Security & Compliance function, adapting to any changes in the legal landscape. 6. **Transparency and Documentation**: Provide detailed documentation and SBOMs for transparency, and ensure all contractual and regulatory requirements are clearly outlined and met." ;
